{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周二早上还是例行的全校集会。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到了第二次，我们各务台学院的学生也已经习惯了。\\n甚至有些女生也加入了和结女校女生一起欢呼的队列。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "到了第二次，我们各务台学院的学生也已经习惯了。甚至有些女生也加入了和结女校女生一起欢呼的队列。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就是所谓的近朱者赤吧……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0249", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男生也一起欢呼会不会比较好？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在开会，不许交头接耳」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0250", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，从这次开始，站在我旁边的就是濑名同学了。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为成为了班委，所以我站在了各务台学院学生的队伍前头，\\n濑名同学则站在了结女校学生的队伍前头。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "因为成为了班委，所以我站在了各务台学院学生的队伍前头，濑名同学则站在了结女校学生的队伍前头。", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『嗯～这次各务台学院的学生们似乎也很兴奋呢』", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "『嗯～这次各务台学院的学生们似乎也很兴奋呢』", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0045", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "站在台上的校长，听着夹杂着各务台学院女生们声音的欢呼声，\\n愉悦地点了点头。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "站在台上的校长，听着夹杂着各务台学院女生们声音的欢呼声，愉悦地点了点头。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『男生们还在害羞吗？\\n　可以跟着一起喊啊，校长～就这么喊♪』", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "『男生们还在害羞吗？　可以跟着一起喊啊，校长～就这么喊♪』", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0046", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好嘞，我试试看吧？\\n　校长，请你辱骂我吧～这么喊！」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「好嘞，我试试看吧？　校长，请你辱骂我吧～这么喊！」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太同学，没想到你还是个Ｍ？！」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0194", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他要是真这么说了，应该会被结女校的女生们骂个狗血淋头，\\n　不过对于隼太这个Ｍ来说，确实非常划算啊」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「他要是真这么说了，应该会被结女校的女生们骂个狗血淋头，　不过对于隼太这个Ｍ来说，确实非常划算啊」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别以我是Ｍ为前提来推动话题啊！\\n　不过还挺有趣的所以无所谓了」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「别以我是Ｍ为前提来推动话题啊！　不过还挺有趣的所以无所谓了」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说了不许交头接耳！」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0251", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，就算没有跟着欢呼，\\n大家还是因为校长的话题而热闹了起来。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "不过，就算没有跟着欢呼，大家还是因为校长的话题而热闹了起来。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "男生们，至少我和隼太两个近朱者\\n已经多多少少被氛围所染赤了一些。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "男生们，至少我和隼太两个近朱者已经多多少少被氛围所染赤了一些。", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——相反，按照那个论调来说，\\n只有濑名同学一个人保持着自己孤高的颜色没被浸染。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "——相反，按照那个论调来说，只有濑名同学一个人保持着自己孤高的颜色没被浸染。", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『老实说啊～我个人觉得，\\n　体育课也应该是男女混合才好！』", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "『老实说啊～我个人觉得，　体育课也应该是男女混合才好！』", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0047", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，校长也兴致满满地煽动起学生们。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『这样的话，我也得参加！\\n　也会穿上体操服的，我现在也依旧活力满满哦～』", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "『这样的话，我也得参加！　也会穿上体操服的，我现在也依旧活力满满哦～』", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0048", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
