{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，午饭……啊，熊喵、天羽学姐」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0255", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总有种客流不断的感觉呢！\\n　这正是安洁大显身手的时候——」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": "「总有种客流不断的感觉呢！　这正是安洁大显身手的时候——」", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0195", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是临时并校的第二周的最后一天，\\n连午休时间也已经变得如此不同了。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "今天是临时并校的第二周的最后一天，连午休时间也已经变得如此不同了。", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呦，小樱。\\n　带了便当吗？跟我们一起吃吧」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「呦，小樱。　带了便当吗？跟我们一起吃吧」", "plain_idx": 384, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
