{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然，天羽学姐把手伸向我脖子前，\\n让我有点心跳加速。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": "突然，天羽学姐把手伸向我脖子前，让我有点心跳加速。", "plain_idx": 405, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你的领带歪了……好了，这样就没问题了」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，真是非常感谢」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能够无意中注意到这种细节，\\n真不愧是天羽学姐啊。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "能够无意中注意到这种细节，真不愧是天羽学姐啊。", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0257", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——！我以前就一直在心里暗自想着，\\n　美羽同学，这是何等天然的女仆力啊！」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "「啊——！我以前就一直在心里暗自想着，　美羽同学，这是何等天然的女仆力啊！」", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0199", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁不会认输的……安洁、\\n　安洁遇到危机了！作为真正的女仆，现在！」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「安洁不会认输的……安洁、　安洁遇到危机了！作为真正的女仆，现在！」", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0200", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……安洁对天羽学姐燃起竞争意识了？", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「糟糕！安洁又对美羽学姐！」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0052", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又对？！」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家快逃——！！」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0053", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里只能用出非常手段了……！」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0201", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～！安洁不小心把茶具给打翻了——！！」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "「哎呀～！安洁不小心把茶具给打翻了——！！」", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0202", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说这是故意的吧……」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过不用担心，安洁会搞定的！\\n　会华丽地收拾好的」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": "「不过不用担心，安洁会搞定的！　会华丽地收拾好的」", "plain_idx": 432, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0203", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这完全是自导自演啊！」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你好，那边的同学！不要纠结那么多的细节！」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0204", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，简而言之。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有展示的机会那就自己创造，\\n这位麻烦的女仆还真是过于主动啊。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": "没有展示的机会那就自己创造，这位麻烦的女仆还真是过于主动啊。", "plain_idx": 440, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请大家放心，为了不添麻烦，\\n　安洁是非常小心地将茶具打翻的」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": "「请大家放心，为了不添麻烦，　安洁是非常小心地将茶具打翻的」", "plain_idx": 442, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0205", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，还真是。茶具没有破损，\\n　水也几乎没有洒出来……」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": "「啊，还真是。茶具没有破损，　水也几乎没有洒出来……」", "plain_idx": 445, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这自导自演考虑得真是周到」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0258", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，也是常有的事了，真的。\\n　不过还挺有趣所以也无所谓了」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": "「不过，也是常有的事了，真的。　不过还挺有趣所以也无所谓了」", "plain_idx": 449, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0054", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
