{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学突然回来了，\\n看到我们后，脸上露出了苦涩的表情，一时语塞。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": "濑名同学突然回来了，看到我们后，脸上露出了苦涩的表情，一时语塞。", "plain_idx": 461, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
