{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥是哥，好朋友是好朋友」", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0260", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理也乖乖地沉迷于美羽学姐的魅力沦为俘虏就好了」", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0055", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样的话，熊喵就可以交给爱理，\\n　而我就能独享美羽学姐了！」", "text_idx": 485, "plain": "「那样的话，熊喵就可以交给爱理，　而我就能独享美羽学姐了！」", "plain_idx": 486, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0056", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你啊……」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0259", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我理解了，爱理同学。\\n　总之，我先给你泡杯茶吧？」", "text_idx": 490, "plain": "「我理解了，爱理同学。　总之，我先给你泡杯茶吧？」", "plain_idx": 491, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0207", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
